sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Kafka as Kafka<br/>order.confirmed
  participant Kitchen as Kitchen<br/>OrderConfirmedConsumer
  participant KdsRepo as KdsRedisRepository
  participant Redis as Redis<br/>KDS Sorted Set
  participant Pub as KitchenEventsPublisher
  participant BFF as BFF<br/>Realtime + TCP edge
  participant UI as KDS UI<br/>Kitchen/Bar screen
  actor Chef as Chef
  participant Order as Order<br/>item readiness

  Kafka->>Kitchen: Deliver order.confirmed
  Kitchen->>Kitchen: Parse JSON and validate schemaVersion = 1
  Kitchen->>KdsRepo: createTicketsFromConfirmedOrder(event)
  KdsRepo->>Redis: Write station tickets and queue revision
  KdsRepo-->>Kitchen: KdsQueueChangedEvent[]
  Kitchen->>Pub: publishMany(events)
  Pub->>Redis: PUBLISH realtime:kds:{tenantId}
  Redis-->>BFF: Redis pub/sub event
  BFF-->>UI: WebSocket hint kds.queue_changed
  UI->>BFF: Refetch GET /kds/queue
  BFF->>Kitchen: TCP KITCHEN.GET_QUEUE(station)
  Kitchen->>KdsRepo: getQueueSnapshot
  KdsRepo->>Redis: ZRANGE/HGET ticket data
  Kitchen-->>BFF: Queue snapshot
  BFF-->>UI: Authoritative queue data

  Chef->>UI: Start ticket
  UI->>BFF: POST start ticket
  BFF->>Kitchen: TCP KITCHEN.START_TICKET
  Kitchen->>KdsRepo: startTicket
  KdsRepo->>Redis: Move ticket to PROCESSING
  Kitchen->>Pub: Publish TICKET_STARTED
  Pub->>Redis: PUBLISH realtime:kds:{tenantId}
  Redis-->>BFF: Queue changed hint
  BFF-->>UI: WebSocket hint, UI refetches

  Chef->>UI: Mark ticket ready
  UI->>BFF: POST mark ready
  BFF->>Kitchen: TCP KITCHEN.MARK_READY
  Kitchen->>KdsRepo: markReady
  KdsRepo->>Redis: Move ticket to READY
  Kitchen->>Order: TCP ORDER.MARK_ITEMS_READY(orderItemIds, station)
  Order->>Order: Update item READY, if all items ready then order READY
  Order-->>Kitchen: kitchen.item_ready + optional orderStatusChanged
  Kitchen->>Pub: Publish TICKET_READY
  Pub->>Redis: PUBLISH realtime:kds:{tenantId}
  Redis-->>BFF: Queue changed hint
  BFF-->>UI: WebSocket hint, UI refetches

  Note over UI,BFF: WebSocket only notifies that the queue changed, the UI refetches queue state
